{"id":"n83755-1-10","stage":3,"title":"품다 · 抱","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83755-1-10-1","ko":"아기를 품고 어디에 가세요?","zh":"您抱着宝宝要去哪儿啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아기를","meaning":"小孩，婴儿","explanation":"아기：小孩，婴儿；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"아기","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20235","senseId":"1","lemma":"아기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아기를","audio":"/audio/c2dabf389488da4b2cda.mp3"}},{"text":"품고","meaning":"抱，怀抱","explanation":"품다：抱，怀抱；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"품다","audio":"/audio/5d89e66fd1fe9c6e992b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83755","senseId":"1","lemma":"품다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"품고","audio":"/audio/d5feb36f2a77922d2df9.mp3"}},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디에","audio":"/audio/c24ae324e24a5ebc5c5e.mp3"}},{"text":"가세요?","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가세요","audio":"/audio/39535bcbab477dc70750.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d5fa7c0faafdc9fc","term":"아기","zh":"小孩，婴儿","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3","entryId":"20235","definition":"吃着奶的非常幼小的孩子。","pronunciation":["아기"]},{"id":"5d89e66fd1fe9c6e","term":"품다","zh":"抱，怀抱","audio":"/audio/5d89e66fd1fe9c6e992b.mp3","entryId":"83755","definition":"放在怀里或胸前。","pronunciation":["품ː따"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"